# Keep the build context minimal, and keep runtime state out of it.
#
# .weread/ and data/ hold cookies.json (a WeRead login session), login.png and
# logs. They are never COPYed into the image, but without this file the whole
# directory is still sent to the daemon, and with a docker-container builder it
# is uploaded into the builder container. Nothing outside src/, package.json and
# package-lock.json is needed by the Dockerfile.
.git
.github
.gitignore
node_modules
data
.weread
npm-debug.log
